    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41805" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπομένως</span></b> , Adv.
		pres.
		part. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕπομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in a secondary manner,</i>
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρώτως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1030a22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.569e
			</span></i> : opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηγουμένως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				3p.424M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>in accordance with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ νόμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					844e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				405a3
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ τῆς ἀκολουθίας εἱρμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.194
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>next</i> in order, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				736b13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.560
			</span></i>.</div>
